00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:00.170
that was just uploaded.

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:02.210
So now this is available
in my environment

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.940
that I can actually pull down.

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:08.490
Head back over.

00:16:08.490 --> 00:16:13.440
So now that that's
there, we can go ahead

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:20.266
and head back into
our Pet Clinic,

00:16:20.266 --> 00:16:21.390
once it lets me type again.

00:16:29.844 --> 00:16:31.010
You going to let me connect?

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:41.260
Apologies-- network
connectivity.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:44.800
We are reconnecting now.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:47.230
So now that we've
uploaded that, we actually

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.660
just need to add
to our Cloud Build

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:51.010
to actually pull that down.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.290
And wait for that
job is the next step.

00:16:57.369 --> 00:16:58.410
Waiting for this to load.

00:17:04.206 --> 00:17:05.172
Well, that's not fun.

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:09.869
We'll give that another second.

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:33.580
Let's make sure we're
using the hardwire.

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:34.750
Apologies.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.576
I know you've all been enjoying
the Wi-Fi this week, so--

00:17:37.576 --> 00:17:39.040
[LAUGHTER]

00:17:43.432 --> 00:17:46.490
We're going to set up
a hotspot as a backup.

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:47.822
I did test this earlier.

00:17:47.822 --> 00:17:49.155
So we do have a backup solution.

00:17:51.926 --> 00:17:52.426
Cool.

00:17:58.669 --> 00:17:59.710
It's going to take a sec.

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:14.210
Did everyone have fun
at the party last night?

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:17.496
So I never heard of The
Chainsmokers before.

00:18:17.496 --> 00:18:18.620
I had to ask my girlfriend.

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:20.771
I was like, so who
are The Chainsmokers?

00:18:20.771 --> 00:18:23.270
And then she was like, oh, they
like play the song you like.

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:24.581
And I'm like, cool.

00:18:24.581 --> 00:18:26.330
And then I showed up,
and I was like, they

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:28.154
don't sing that song.

00:18:28.154 --> 00:18:29.630
[LAUGHTER]

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:32.660
So that was fun.

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:34.760
I also didn't know who
